## Diagrams

### Mermaid Flowchart

```{#code-mermaid .mermaid caption="Mermaid flowchart"}
graph LR
    A[Start] --> B{Decision}
    B -->|Yes| C[Action 1]
    B -->|No| D[Action 2]
    C --> E[End]
    D --> E
```

### PlantUML Sequence Diagram

```{#code-plantuml .plantuml caption="PlantUML sequence diagram"}
@startuml
actor User
participant "Web App" as Web
participant "API Server" as API
database "Database" as DB

User -> Web: Request page
Web -> API: GET /data
API -> DB: Query
DB --> API: Results
API --> Web: JSON response
Web --> User: Render page
@enduml
```

